---
title: Desktop setup
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state Result <<choice>>
    state Progress <<choice>>
    state "All done" as Done
    state "Needs action" as NeedsAction
    state "Couldn’t check" as Unchecked
    [*] --> Welcome
    Welcome --> Checking : Start setup
    Checking --> Result
    Result --> Passed : Evidence passed
    Result --> NeedsAction : Fix available
    Result --> Unchecked : Evidence unavailable
    NeedsAction --> Checking : Check again
    Unchecked --> Checking : Check again
    Passed --> Progress : Two seconds or Next
    Passed --> Passed : Stay
    NeedsAction --> Progress : Skip allowed
    Unchecked --> Progress : Skip allowed
    Progress --> Checking : Another step needed
    Progress --> Done : Final step
    Done --> Checking : Reopen or regress
    Done --> [*] : Open Hack
